{"legislative_session": "2026RS", "identifier": "HB178", "title": "AN ACT relating to the psychiatric collaborative care model.", "from_organization": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": ["bill"], "subject": ["Administrative Regulations And Proceedings", "Federal Laws And Regulations", "Health And Medical Services", "Health Benefit Plan Mandate", "Insurance, Health", "Local Mandate", "Mental Health"], "abstracts": [{"note": "Summary of Original Version", "abstract": "Create a new section of KRS 304.17A-660 to 304.17A-669 to define \"psychiatric collaborative care model\"; require the commissioner of insurance to promulgate and maintain an administrative regulation to list alterations and additions to relevant billing codes; require health benefit plans that provide coverage for treatment of a mental health condition to provide reimbursement for those benefits that are delivered through the psychiatric collaborative care model; authorize insurers to deny any benefit billed under a covered billing code on grounds of medical necessity if certain conditions are met; apply requirement to health benefit plans issued, delivered, or renewed on or after January 1, 2027; require the Department of Insurance to seek a federal waiver if cost defrayal is determined."}], "other_titles": [], "other_identifiers": [{"identifier": "ocd-bill-ky-2026rs-hb178"}], "actions": [{"description": "introduced in House", "date": "2026-01-07T05:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": ["introduction"], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "to Committee on Committees (H)", "date": "2026-01-07T05:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": ["referral-committee"], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "to Health Services (H)", "date": "2026-01-13T05:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": ["referral-committee"], "related_entities": []}, {"de